      "description": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 20 Fortitude Saving Throw</p>\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> 1 day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> Enfeebled 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Enfeebled 2, and the DC to recover from persistent bleed is increased by 2 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> Enfeebled 3, and the DC to recover from persistent bleed is increased by 5 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> Enfeebled 4, the DC to recover from persistent bleed is increased by 5, and you take 1d8 Bleed Damage{1d8 persistent bleed damage} every 1d4 hours (1 day)</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Effect: Bogwid Fever</p>",
      "collapsed": false
